= Li Zeng's Research

== Space Computing Power Networks

=== Research Watchlist
==== Projects
- [https://github.com/ShipItAndPray/orbital-compute orbital-compute] [https://shipitandpray.github.io/orbital-compute/index.html \[Live Demo\]] — An open-source simulator for scheduling GPU compute jobs across satellite constellations.
- [https://github.com/chrieke/awesome-satellite-imagery-datasets awesome-satellite-imagery-datasets] — A curated list of aerial and satellite imagery datasets for computer vision and deep learning (archived).
- [https://github.com/TiansuanConstellation/MobiCom24-SatelliteCOTS MobiCom24-SatelliteCOTS] [https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.03435 \[Paper\]] — Datasets and analysis tools from real-satellite measurements of COTS computing devices, covering thermal and energy behavior.
- [https://github.com/SpaceNetLab/LeoCC LeoCC] [https://doi.org/10.1145/3718958.3750491 \[Paper\]] — A congestion-control algorithm designed to remain robust under LEO satellite network dynamics.
- [https://github.com/suvambasak/LEOCraft LEOCraft] [https://www.usenix.org/conference/atc25/presentation/basak \[Paper\]] — A modular flow-level simulator for evaluating LEO constellation throughput, latency/stretch, traffic flow, and coverage.

